    "title": "Mansfield couple named Citizens of the Year - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kristie Bowles kbowles@tiogapublishing.com ,\n15 hours ago MANSFIELD — In 1972, Joseph Maresco was looking “to move on and up” from his position at the State University of New York. Joe remembers coming to interview for a position at Mansfield University during which he was taken to the X-Trail Restaurant — no longer in operation — by Rod Kelchner and his wife. During the meal, the trio were spontaneously joined by photographer John McNaney. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
